{"type": "response.output_text.delta", "item_id": "msg_1", "output_index": 0, "content_index": 0, "delta": "Here is ether at a glance:\n\n```view\n<div class=\"stack\" style=\"gap:0\">\n\n  <div class=\"grid\" style=\"grid-template-columns:1fr 130px 1fr 130px 1.4fr 130px 1fr 130px 1fr; gap:0; align-items:stretch\">\n    <div class=\"card tone-info\" id=\"cli\" style=\"grid-column:1\">\n      <div><b>ether-cli</b> <span class=\"badge info\">launcher</span></div>\n      <ul class=\"muted\" style=\"margin:8px 0 0; padding-left:18px\">\n        <li>args</li><li>replay</li><li>plain mode</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card tone-info\" id=\"tui\" style=\"grid-column:3\">\n      <div><b>ether-tui</b> <span class=\"badge info\">frontend</span></div>\n      <ul class=\"muted\" style=\"margin:8px 0 0; padding-left:18px\">\n        <li>composer</li><li>cells</li><li>views</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card tone-accent\" id=\"engine\" style=\"grid-column:5\">\n      <div><b>ether-engine</b> <span class=\"badge\">core</span></div>\n      <ul class=\"muted\" style=\"margin:8px 0 0; padding-left:18px\">\n        <li>turn loop \u00b7 context &amp; history</li>\n        <li>approvals</li>\n        <li>tool router: exec_command, apply_patch, view_image, update_plan, request_user_input</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card tone-violet\" id=\"llm\" style=\"grid-column:7\">\n      <div><b>ether-llm</b> <span class=\"badge info\">clients</span></div>\n      <ul class=\"muted\" style=\"margin:8px 0 0; padding-left:18px\">\n        <li>Responses client</li><li>Chat Completions client</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card tone-violet\" id=\"zro\" style=\"grid-column:9\">\n      <b>Zro API</b>\n      <div class=\"muted\">Chat Completions over SSE \u2192 <b>GLM 5.3</b></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid\" style=\"grid-template-columns:1fr 130px 1fr 130px 1.4fr 130px 1fr 130px 1fr; gap:0; margin-top:80px\">\n    <div class=\"card\" id=\"sandbox\" style=\"grid-column:3 / span 2\">\n      <b>codex-sandboxing</b>\n      <div class=\"muted\">Seatbelt (macOS) \u00b7 bubblewrap (Linux) \u00b7 pty</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card\" id=\"rollout\" style=\"grid-column:6 / span 2\">\n      <b>codex-rollout</b>\n      <div class=\"muted\">session recording</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <x-edge from=\"cli\" to=\"tui\" label=\"launches\"></x-edge>\n  <x-edge from=\"tui\" to=\"engine\" label=\"Op in\" tone=\"accent\"></x-edge>\n  <x-edge from=\"engine\" to=\"tui\" label=\"EventMsg out\" tone=\"accent\" dashed></x-edge>\n  <x-edge from=\"engine\" to=\"llm\" label=\"calls\" tone=\"violet\"></x-edge>\n  <x-edge from=\"llm\" to=\"zro\" label=\"SSE\" tone=\"violet\"></x-edge>\n  <x-edge from=\"engine\" to=\"sandbox\" label=\"runs commands\"></x-edge>\n  <x-edge from=\"engine\" to=\"rollout\" label=\"records\"></x-edge>\n\n  <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">\n    <span class=\"badge\">contract</span>\n    <span>The TUI drives ether-engine <b>only</b> through <b>codex-protocol</b> messages: <code>Op</code> in, <code>EventMsg</code> out. Nothing else crosses the boundary.</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\" style=\"gap:14px; align-items:stretch; margin-top:20px\">\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"flex:1.3\">\n      <div><b>Rust lines</b></div>\n      <x-bars unit=\"loc\">\n        <x-bar label=\"tui\" value=\"34602\" tone=\"info\"></x-bar>\n        <x-bar label=\"engine\" value=\"7740\" tone=\"accent\"></x-bar>\n        <x-bar label=\"llm\" value=\"1860\" tone=\"violet\"></x-bar>\n        <x-bar label=\"ui-spec\" value=\"211\"></x-bar>\n      </x-bars>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"flex:1\">\n      <div><b>Prompt cache hit rate</b></div>\n      <x-gauge label=\"cache hits\" value=\"94\" max=\"100\" type=\"ring\" tone=\"ok\"></x-gauge>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"flex:1.2\">\n      <div><b>Tokens per turn</b> <span class=\"muted\">last 10 turns</span></div>\n      <x-spark values=\"3.0 4.0 3.6 5.0 4.8 6.0 5.6 6.8 6.5 7.1\"></x-spark>\n      <div class=\"muted\">rising trend: 3.0k \u2192 7.1k</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n```\n\nArrows show the one-turn flow; the bottom row is live workspace data."}
